        "body": "After several days, your response patterns may be more useful than the forecast itself."
      }
    ],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "Are horoscopes scientific?",
        "answer": "No. Astrology is a symbolic interpretation system, not scientific prediction. Use daily horoscopes for reflection and conversation."
      },
      {
        "question": "Is a Sun-sign horoscope accurate for everyone?",
        "answer": "Not exactly. The Sun sign is only one layer of the natal chart, so personal experience varies."
      },
      {
        "question": "Should I postpone plans after a difficult horoscope?",
        "answer": "Not because of the horoscope alone. Let it remind you to check energy, preparation, and assumptions."
      }
    ],
    "reading": [
      {
        "href": "https://wiki.oiyo.net/en/meaning-of-astrology/",
        "label": "Meaning of Astrology",
        "desc": "A guide to zodiac signs and astrology basics."
      },
      {
        "href": "https://blog.oiyo.net/en/western-astrology-vs-saju-comparison/",
        "label": "Astrology vs Saju",
        "desc": "Compare Western signs with East Asian saju."
      }
    ],
    "disclaimer": "Daily horoscopes are for entertainment and self-reflection. They do not replace career, financial, medical, or legal decisions."
  },
  "ja": {
    "faqTitle": "よくある質問",
    "readingTitle": "詳しく読む",
    "introTitle": "今日の星占いは一日を決めるものではなく、太陽星座の象徴で姿勢を点検します",
    "intro": "デイリー星占いは、太陽星座を基準に今日の雰囲気と意識したい姿勢を象徴的に提案します。確定した予言ではなく軽い自己点検として受け取りましょう。",
    "conceptTitle": "相性の主な考え方",
    "concepts": [
      {
        "title": "四元素",
        "body": "火・地・風・水は関係の速度、安定感、会話、感情の流れを象徴します。"
      },
      {
        "title": "三区分",
        "body": "活動・固定・柔軟は始める、保つ、調整するリズムを示します。"
      },
      {
        "title": "太陽星座の限界",
        "body": "太陽星座の相性は入口です。月や上昇宮まで見ると立体的になります。"
      }
    ],
    "useTitle": "関係での使い方",
    "useCases": [
      {
        "title": "相手の言葉を聞く",
        "body": "「なぜそうなの？」を「何が楽で何が重い？」に変えてみます。"
      },
      {
        "title": "衝突をリズムとして見る",
        "body": "速い人と遅い人の違いを欠点ではなくテンポの差として扱います。"
      },
      {
        "title": "全体図へ広げる",
        "body": "深く見るなら太陽星座だけでなく月、金星、火星、上昇宮も見ます。"
